<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" agent="cip-generator" version="24.7.0" type="device"><diagram id="d0" name="00 Cover &amp; Decisions"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1990" pageHeight="1445" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="p0_1" value='&lt;b style="font-size:26px"&gt;Crypto Intelligence Platform (CIP) - Architecture Design Pack&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12px;color:#555555"&gt;v2.0 - 21 Nov 2026 - Scope: real-time market-data pipeline, analytics, ML, quant research and PAPER trading (no live order routing) - Method: C4 model (L1-L3) + data-flow, data, API, sequence and deployment views - one level per page, one flow direction per diagram&lt;/span&gt;' style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="20" width="1900" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0_2" value='&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;table cellspacing="2" cellpadding="1" style="font-size:10px;"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor="#dae8fc" style="border:1px solid #6c8ebf;width:26px;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Application container (own code)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor="#ffe6cc" style="border:1px solid #d79b00;width:26px;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Processing engine job (Flink / Spark / Airflow)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor="#e1d5e7" style="border:1px solid #9673a6;width:26px;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Kafka cluster / topic (pill)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor="#d5e8d4" style="border:1px solid #82b366;width:26px;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Datastore (cylinder)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px dashed #666666;width:26px;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;External system (dashed)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td align="center"&gt;&amp;#9472;&amp;#9472;&amp;#9654;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Synchronous call / connection&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td align="center"&gt;&amp;#9480;&amp;#9480;&amp;#9654;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Asynchronous / event via Kafka&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#555555"&gt;Pipeline pages: arrow = data flow. Access pages: arrow = caller -&amp;gt; callee.&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="130" width="330" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0_3" value="&lt;b&gt;How to read / build&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Engineers: 06 -&gt; 07 -&gt; 08 -&gt; 15-16 -&gt; 17 (contracts first, then data, then spec cards).&lt;br&gt;Reviewers: 01 -&gt; 02..05 -&gt; 12 -&gt; 14.&lt;br&gt;Every arrow in pages 02-05 maps to a topic (06) or an API (07); every container has a spec card (15-16) and appears in a sequence (10-11).&lt;br&gt;Colours (max 5): blue app, orange processing engine, purple Kafka, green datastore, grey external." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="390" y="130" width="520" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0_4" value='&lt;div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;padding:2px 0 4px 0;"&gt;Page index&lt;/div&gt;&lt;table border="1" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border-color:#999999;font-size:10px;width:100%;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;&lt;tr style="background:#dae8fc;font-weight:bold;"&gt;&lt;td valign="top" width="11.1%"&gt;Page&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" width="55.6%"&gt;Content&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" width="33.3%"&gt;Primary reader&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;00&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Cover, assumptions, decisions (ADR)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Everyone - read first&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;01&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;L1 System Context&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Executives, new joiners&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;02&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;L2-A Access &amp;amp; request path&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Backend / frontend / security&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;03&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;L2-B Ingestion &amp;amp; normalization&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Data engineers&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;04&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;L2-C Stream &amp;amp; batch processing, stores&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Data engineers&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;05&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;L2-D Quant, ML &amp;amp; paper trading&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Quant / ML / trading engineers&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;06&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Kafka topic catalog &amp;amp; conventions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;All service owners (contract)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;07&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Event schemas &amp;amp; API contracts (REST, WebSocket)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;All service owners (contract)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;08&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Data architecture: DDL, tables, buckets, keys, ownership&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Backend / data engineers&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;09&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;L3 Component views&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Implementers of the 4 key containers&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;10&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Sequence diagrams A (real-time)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Implementers, testers&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;11&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Sequence diagrams B (research, ML)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Implementers, testers&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;12&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Deployment (Kubernetes), environments, CI/CD&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;DevOps / SRE&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;13&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Observability, security, SLO, NFR&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;SRE / security&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;14&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Failure modes &amp;amp; risk register&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Everyone&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;15-16&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Service spec cards (26 containers)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Implementers - definition of done&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;17&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Repo layout &amp;amp; roadmap (M0-M6)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Tech lead, PM&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;' style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="350" width="880" height="408" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0_5" value='&lt;div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;padding:2px 0 4px 0;"&gt;Assumptions (verify, ask if wrong)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;table border="1" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border-color:#999999;font-size:10px;width:100%;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;&lt;tr style="background:#dae8fc;font-weight:bold;"&gt;&lt;td valign="top" width="7.7%"&gt;ID&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" width="92.3%"&gt;Assumption / change vs draft&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;A1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Single Kubernetes cluster, 1 region / 3 zones, cloud-agnostic (MinIO = S3 API).&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;A2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Up to 100 spot symbols, &amp;lt;= 5,000 msg/s sustained (about 50 msg/s per symbol).&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;A3&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Latency targets: tick -&amp;gt; dashboard p95 &amp;lt;= 500 ms; tick -&amp;gt; signal p95 &amp;lt;= 1 s.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;A4&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Team of 3-6; Python 3.12 default; Flink via PyFlink (Java fallback for hot paths).&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;A5&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Coinbase public market-data channels only; no trading permission, no trading keys exist.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;A6&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Keycloak self-hosted; &amp;lt;= 50 users.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;A7&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Retention: Kafka raw 3 d, normalized 7 d; lake 365 d; ticks in ClickHouse 90 d hot; candles forever.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;A8&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Observability = Grafana LGTM (Prometheus, Loki, Tempo, Grafana) + OpenTelemetry.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;A9&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;ADDED vs draft: Keycloak, Schema Registry, dlq-replayer, query-api, command-api, realtime-gateway, lake-archiver, Airflow, MLflow, Tempo, Alertmanager, Argo CD.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;A10&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;REMOVED vs draft: candle-service, feature-service (-&amp;gt; Flink jobs), "Producers" box, Kubernetes as a data-flow node (-&amp;gt; deployment view). Budget unknown: cost = TBD.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;' style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="950" y="130" width="980" height="274" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0_6" value='&lt;div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;padding:2px 0 4px 0;"&gt;Design decisions (ADR-lite)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;table border="1" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border-color:#999999;font-size:10px;width:100%;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;&lt;tr style="background:#dae8fc;font-weight:bold;"&gt;&lt;td valign="top" width="5.3%"&gt;ID&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" width="42.1%"&gt;Decision&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" width="15.8%"&gt;Alternatives&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" width="36.8%"&gt;Trade-off / consequence&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;ADR-01&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Lambda-lite. Kafka = system of record for streams. Flink = ONLY real-time compute (candles, features, archiving). Spark = batch ONLY (compaction, backfill, offline features).&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Full Lambda with duplicated logic; Kappa with Flink only.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Two engines cost ops effort. Mitigation: candle/feature definitions live once in cip-core. Revisit at M3: with &amp;lt;= 100 symbols replace Spark by Flink batch / Polars.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;ADR-02&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Remove standalone candle-service and feature-service; Flink jobs candle-aggregator and feature-engine are the single owners.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Keep Python services next to Flink.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Removes the duplicated responsibility in the draft; one real-time code path; batch recompute uses the same spec.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;ADR-03&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;data-validator = per-message gate (schema + rules -&amp;gt; DLQ). data-quality = windowed monitoring (gaps, staleness, volume anomalies) -&amp;gt; incidents + metrics.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Merge into one service.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Different state and latency profile; validator stays stateless and scales with KEDA.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;ADR-04&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Data ownership: schema-per-service in PostgreSQL with separate roles; ClickHouse market.* written only by Kafka-engine MVs and spark-batch; MinIO prefix, Redis key prefix per writer.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Shared DB with free access (draft).&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;No hidden coupling. Cross-owner reads use read-only roles or owner API (matrix on page 08).&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;ADR-05&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;At-least-once everywhere + idempotent consumers (event_id, trade_id). Flink -&amp;gt; Kafka uses exactly-once transactions. Key = symbol =&amp;gt; per-symbol order. ClickHouse dedupe via ReplacingMergeTree.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;End-to-end exactly-once.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Simpler and robust; duplicates are expected and handled. Cost: dedupe state in Flink (10 min TTL).&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;ADR-06&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Live fan-out: realtime-gateway consumes Kafka directly (ephemeral groups, latest, no commit) + Redis snapshot on subscribe; sequence number per channel.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Redis Pub/Sub (no replay / seq); separate bridge service.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Fewer hops, lower latency. Revisit at &amp;gt; 1,000 concurrent clients: add a Redis fan-out tier.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;ADR-07&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;api-gateway = authN/Z, routing, rate-limit only. CQRS: query-api (reads) / command-api (writes). WebSocket bypasses api-gateway.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Gateway reading databases (draft).&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Removes layer bypass; services scale independently; long-lived WS do not pin the gateway.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;ADR-08&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Backtest/live parity: strategies implemented once in strategy-core; execution simulator (fees, slippage, latency) shared by paper-execution and backtesting.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Separate research and live code.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Avoids research-to-production drift; strategy-core version recorded with every run.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;ADR-09&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;MLflow (tracking + registry; backend PG, artifacts MinIO). Promotion by alias champion; model-inference polls alias (60 s) and hot-swaps; model-monitoring uses PSI / KS vs training baseline.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Custom registry.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Standard tooling; rollback = move alias.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;ADR-10&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Paper-trading boundary: ExecutionPort interface implemented only by paper-execution. Live trading would add live-execution in a separate trust zone behind pre-trade risk gate + 2-person approval.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Build live trading now.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Safe scope; no exchange trading credentials in the platform.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;ADR-11&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Avro + Schema Registry, compatibility BACKWARD_TRANSITIVE; topics versioned .vN; breaking change = new topic + dual-publish for &amp;gt;= 1 retention period.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;JSON without schema.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Contract tests in CI block incompatible changes.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;ADR-12&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Keycloak OIDC (JWT RS256), scopes market:read, trading:read, research:write, ops:admin; service-to-service mTLS (Linkerd); Kafka mTLS + ACL per service principal.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Static API keys.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Central identity, short-lived tokens, least privilege.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;ADR-13&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Wire format: every Avro topic uses Confluent wire format (magic byte 0x00 + 4-byte schema ID). One shared serializer/deserializer in cip-kafka; subject = &amp;lt;topic&amp;gt;-value; schemas registered by CI (auto.register.schemas=false outside local dev). ClickHouse AvroConfluent and Flink read the same format.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Raw schemaless Avro bytes without wire header.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Allows ClickHouse Kafka-engine AvroConfluent and Flink to decode seamlessly with Schema Registry schema ID caching.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;ADR-14&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Source feed: Coinbase Exchange public WSS (wss://ws-feed.exchange.coinbase.com; checked 2026-11-22 via https://docs.cdp.coinbase.com/exchange/docs/websocket-channels/#matches-channel). Trade gap detection uses exchange trade_id (strictly contiguous N, N+1; verified 10-min live capture: 4,599 trades, 0 gaps, 100% contiguous); sequence is exchange-wide orderbook sequence with expected gaps on matches channel (verified: 4,598 gaps, 0% contiguous, max gap 1,267); source_seq records exchange sequence for L3 correlation.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Use sequence for trade gap detection; poll REST ticker.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Aligns gap detection with true trade continuity (trade_id contiguous 100%) while preserving orderbook sequence for cross-channel audit.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;ADR-15&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Feed liveness and reconnect: staleness is measured per symbol on any frame including heartbeat; a symbol is stale after 5 s without a frame; metric and gap event are emitted and do NOT fail pod-level /readyz. Pod /readyz = WS connected + Kafka producer reachable. Reconnect sleep = min(30, backoff * uniform(0.5, 1.5)) starting at 1 s.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Unbounded backoff without jitter; failing /readyz on single symbol staleness.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top" style="word-wrap:break-word;"&gt;Guarantees fast failover without cascading pod restarts while alerting on isolated symbol feed drops.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;' style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="798" width="1900" height="587" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="d1" name="01 L1 System Context"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1560" pageHeight="900" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="p1_1" value='&lt;b style="font-size:20px"&gt;L1 - System Context&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:11px;color:#555555"&gt;Crypto Intelligence Platform (CIP) - users and external systems - v2.0 - 21 Nov 2026 - arrow = caller -&amp;gt; callee&lt;/span&gt;' style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1800" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1_2" value="Trader / Researcher" style="shape=umlActor;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;html=1;outlineConnect=0;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="150" width="36" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1_3" value="Platform Operator (SRE)" style="shape=umlActor;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;html=1;outlineConnect=0;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="450" width="36" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1_4" value='&lt;b&gt;Crypto Intelligence Platform&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#444444"&gt;[Software System]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#222222"&gt;Ingests market data, computes candles &amp;amp; features, runs quant research, ML and PAPER trading; serves dashboards and APIs.&lt;/span&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;rounded=1;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="520" y="200" width="440" height="260" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1_5" value='&lt;b&gt;Coinbase&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#444444"&gt;[External System: market-data feed]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#222222"&gt;Public WSS channels (trades, ticker) + REST (candles, trades)&lt;/span&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;rounded=1;arcSize=8;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1200" y="130" width="300" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1_6" value='&lt;b&gt;Slack / PagerDuty&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#444444"&gt;[External System: alert receiver]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#222222"&gt;Receives alerts from Alertmanager&lt;/span&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;rounded=1;arcSize=8;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1200" y="330" width="300" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1_7" value='&lt;b&gt;GitHub&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#444444"&gt;[External System: repo + Actions + GHCR]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#222222"&gt;Source, CI, container registry; Argo CD pulls manifests&lt;/span&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;rounded=1;arcSize=8;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1200" y="520" width="300" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1_8" value="Views dashboards, runs backtests,&lt;br&gt;monitors paper P&amp;amp;L [HTTPS / WSS]" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.3;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p1_2" target="p1_4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p1_9" value="Operates: DLQ replay, Grafana,&lt;br&gt;rollouts [HTTPS]" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.75;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p1_3" target="p1_4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p1_10" value="Subscribes to live trades [WSS]&lt;br&gt;Pulls history [HTTPS REST]" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;exitX=1;exitY=0.15;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p1_4" target="p1_5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p1_11" value="Sends alerts [Webhook]" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p1_4" target="p1_6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p1_12" value="Pulls manifests / images [HTTPS]" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;exitX=1;exitY=0.85;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p1_4" target="p1_7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p1_13" value="&lt;b&gt;Out of scope (this release)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Live order routing, custody, fiat on/off-ramp. Coinbase public channels need no trading credentials (ADR-10)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="520" y="500" width="440" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1_14" value='&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;table cellspacing="2" cellpadding="1" style="font-size:10px;"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor="#dae8fc" style="border:1px solid #6c8ebf;width:26px;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Application container (own code)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor="#ffe6cc" style="border:1px solid #d79b00;width:26px;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Processing engine job (Flink / Spark / Airflow)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor="#e1d5e7" style="border:1px solid #9673a6;width:26px;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Kafka cluster / topic (pill)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor="#d5e8d4" style="border:1px solid #82b366;width:26px;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Datastore (cylinder)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px dashed #666666;width:26px;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;External system (dashed)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td align="center"&gt;&amp;#9472;&amp;#9472;&amp;#9654;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Synchronous call / connection&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td align="center"&gt;&amp;#9480;&amp;#9480;&amp;#9654;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Asynchronous / event via Kafka&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#555555"&gt;Arrow = caller -&amp;gt; callee&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="650" width="330" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="d2" name="02 L2-A Access &amp; Request Path"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1820" pageHeight="910" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="p2_1" value='&lt;b style="font-size:20px"&gt;L2-A - Container view: Access &amp;amp; request path (synchronous)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:11px;color:#555555"&gt;Arrow = caller -&amp;gt; callee - no client-&amp;gt;datastore and no gateway-&amp;gt;datastore access - Kafka drawn as one container (topic detail: pages 03-06)&lt;/span&gt;' style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1800" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2_2" value="Traders / Researchers" style="shape=umlActor;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;html=1;outlineConnect=0;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="320" width="36" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2_3" value='&lt;b&gt;web-dashboard&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#444444"&gt;[Container: React 18 SPA, Vite, TypeScript]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#222222"&gt;Charts, research &amp;amp; paper-trading UI; OIDC PKCE login&lt;/span&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;rounded=1;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="170" y="300" width="220" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2_4" value='&lt;b&gt;nginx-ingress&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#444444"&gt;[Container: NGINX Ingress Controller]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#222222"&gt;TLS termination; /api -&amp;gt; gateway, /ws -&amp;gt; realtime-gateway&lt;/span&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;rounded=1;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="470" y="300" width="220" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2_5" value='&lt;b&gt;api-gateway&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#444444"&gt;[Container: FastAPI]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#222222"&gt;JWT verify, scope check, rate limit, routing. NO datastore access&lt;/span&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;rounded=1;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="770" y="300" width="240" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2_6" value='&lt;b&gt;keycloak&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#444444"&gt;[Container: Keycloak 25, OIDC]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#222222"&gt;Identity provider; issues JWT (RS256); roles viewer / researcher / admin&lt;/span&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;rounded=1;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="770" y="110" width="240" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2_7" value='&lt;b&gt;realtime-gateway&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#444444"&gt;[Container: FastAPI / Starlette WebSocket]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#222222"&gt;WSS fan-out, snapshot + delta; validates JWT itself (bypasses api-gateway)&lt;/span&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;rounded=1;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="770" y="560" width="240" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2_8" value='&lt;b&gt;query-api&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#444444"&gt;[Container: FastAPI]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#222222"&gt;Read side (CQRS): candles, features, signals, positions, results&lt;/span&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;rounded=1;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="150" width="240" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2_9" value='&lt;b&gt;command-api&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#444444"&gt;[Container: FastAPI]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#222222"&gt;Write side: jobs, strategy toggle, DLQ replay; audit log&lt;/span&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;rounded=1;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="300" width="240" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2_10" value='&lt;b&gt;ClickHouse&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#444444"&gt;[Datastore: market.*]&lt;/span&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1560" y="100" width="200" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2_11" value='&lt;b&gt;PostgreSQL&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#444444"&gt;[Datastore: schemas per service]&lt;/span&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1560" y="230" width="200" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2_12" value='&lt;b&gt;Redis&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#444444"&gt;[Datastore: snap:* feat:* ratelimit:*]&lt;/span&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1560" y="360" width="200" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2_13" value='&lt;b&gt;kafka-cluster&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#444444"&gt;[Container: Apache Kafka 3.8 KRaft]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#222222"&gt;topics: page 06&lt;/span&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;rounded=1;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1560" y="500" width="200" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2_14" value="HTTPS" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p2_2" target="p2_3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p2_15" value="HTTPS /api - WSS /ws" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p2_3" target="p2_4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p2_16" value="OIDC code + PKCE [HTTPS]" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p2_3" target="p2_6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p2_17" value="REST /api/* [HTTP]" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p2_4" target="p2_5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p2_18" value="WebSocket /ws [WS]" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p2_4" target="p2_7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p2_19" value="JWKS fetch, cached [HTTPS]" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p2_5" target="p2_6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p2_20" value="GET /v1/* [HTTP]" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;exitX=1;exitY=0.25;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p2_5" target="p2_8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p2_21" value="POST / PUT /v1/* [HTTP]" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p2_5" target="p2_9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p2_22" value="SQL (read) [HTTP]" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;exitX=1;exitY=0.25;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p2_8" target="p2_10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p2_23" value="SQL (read)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.3;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p2_8" target="p2_11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p2_24" value="GET (read) [RESP]" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;exitX=1;exitY=0.75;entryX=0;entryY=0.3;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p2_8" target="p2_12"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p2_25" value="INSERT jobs [SQL]" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;exitX=1;exitY=0.3;entryX=0;entryY=0.8;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p2_9" target="p2_11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p2_26" value="jobs, commands [Kafka]" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;exitX=1;exitY=0.85;entryX=0;entryY=0.2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p2_9" target="p2_13"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p2_27" value="GET snap:* [RESP]" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;exitX=1;exitY=0.3;entryX=0;entryY=0.67;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p2_7" target="p2_12"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1480" y="593"/><mxPoint x="1480" y="420"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p2_28" value="candles, signals, positions" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;exitX=0;exitY=0.7;entryX=1;entryY=0.75;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p2_13" target="p2_7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1440" y="577"/><mxPoint x="1440" y="642"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p2_29" value='&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;table cellspacing="2" cellpadding="1" style="font-size:10px;"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor="#dae8fc" style="border:1px solid #6c8ebf;width:26px;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Application container (own code)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor="#ffe6cc" style="border:1px solid #d79b00;width:26px;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Processing engine job (Flink / Spark / Airflow)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor="#e1d5e7" style="border:1px solid #9673a6;width:26px;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Kafka cluster / topic (pill)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor="#d5e8d4" style="border:1px solid #82b366;width:26px;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Datastore (cylinder)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px dashed #666666;width:26px;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;External system (dashed)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td align="center"&gt;&amp;#9472;&amp;#9472;&amp;#9654;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Synchronous call / connection&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td align="center"&gt;&amp;#9480;&amp;#9480;&amp;#9654;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Asynchronous / event via Kafka&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#555555"&gt;Arrow = caller -&amp;gt; callee&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="520" width="330" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2_30" value="&lt;b&gt;Design rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1) api-gateway = authN/Z + routing + rate-limit only (counters in Redis ratelimit:*).&lt;br&gt;2) Reads -&gt; query-api (CQRS read side); writes -&gt; command-api. Both own their datastore access via per-service DB roles.&lt;br&gt;3) WebSocket bypasses api-gateway (long-lived connections); realtime-gateway verifies the JWT itself (ADR-06, ADR-07).&lt;br&gt;4) Every container emits OTel traces/metrics/logs (page 13)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="170" y="730" width="1100" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="d3" name="03 L2-B Ingestion &amp; Normalization"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2660" pageHeight="950" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="p3_1" value='&lt;b style="font-size:20px"&gt;L2-B - Container view: Ingestion &amp;amp; normalization (event-driven)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:11px;color:#555555"&gt;Arrow = direction of data flow - dashed = via Kafka - topic pills: key / partitions / retention - failure path (DLQ + replay) included&lt;/span&gt;' style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1800" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3_2" value='&lt;b&gt;Coinbase WebSocket&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#444444"&gt;[External System: feed]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#222222"&gt;trades, ticker, heartbeat&lt;/span&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;rounded=1;arcSize=8;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="100" width="170" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3_3" value='&lt;b&gt;market-collector&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#444444"&gt;[Container: Python 3.12, asyncio]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#222222"&gt;Subscribes WSS, stamps event_id / ingest_ts, publishes raw frames. State: PG collector.*&lt;/span&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;rounded=1;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="100" width="230" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3_4" value='&lt;b&gt;market.raw.v1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9px"&gt;key=symbol - 12p - 3d&lt;/span&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;rounded=1;arcSize=50;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="122" width="210" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3_5" value='&lt;b&gt;Coinbase REST API&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#444444"&gt;[External System: public]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#222222"&gt;candles, trades (rate-limited)&lt;/span&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;rounded=1;arcSize=8;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="400" width="170" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3_6" value='&lt;b&gt;historical-ingestor&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#444444"&gt;[Container: Python 3.12, httpx]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#222222"&gt;Backfills candles/trades; consumes BackfillRequest (ops.commands.v1); cursor in PG.&lt;/span&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;rounded=1;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="400" width="230" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3_7" value='&lt;b&gt;market.raw.backfill.v1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9px"&gt;key=symbol - 6p - 7d&lt;/span&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;rounded=1;arcSize=50;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="422" width="210" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3_8" value='&lt;b&gt;data-validator&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#444444"&gt;[Container: Python 3.12, confluent-kafka]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#222222"&gt;Per-message gate: Avro schema + business rules. Valid -&amp;gt; validated, invalid -&amp;gt; DLQ. Stateless.&lt;/span&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;rounded=1;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="960" y="250" width="240" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3_9" value='&lt;b&gt;market.validated.v1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9px"&gt;key=symbol - 12p - 3d&lt;/span&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;rounded=1;arcSize=50;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1310" y="272" width="210" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3_10" value='&lt;b&gt;market-normalizer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#444444"&gt;[Container: Python 3.12]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#222222"&gt;Canonical model: BTC-USD symbols, Decimal prices, UTC microsecond timestamps. Stateless.&lt;/span&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;rounded=1;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1630" y="250" width="240" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3_11" value='&lt;b&gt;market.normalized.v1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9px"&gt;key=symbol - 12p - 7d&lt;/span&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;rounded=1;arcSize=50;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1980" y="272" width="210" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3_12" value='&lt;b&gt;data-quality&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#444444"&gt;[Container: Python 3.12]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#222222"&gt;Windowed checks (gaps, staleness, dup-rate, price spikes) -&amp;gt; PG dq.incidents + metrics.&lt;/span&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;rounded=1;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2300" y="250" width="240" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3_13" value='&lt;b&gt;schema-registry&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#444444"&gt;[Container: Apicurio, Confluent-compatible]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#222222"&gt;Avro schemas; BACKWARD_TRANSITIVE; checked in CI.&lt;/span&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;rounded=1;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1295" y="100" width="240" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3_14" value='&lt;b&gt;market.dlq.v1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9px"&gt;headers: error_code, src_offset - 30d&lt;/span&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;rounded=1;arcSize=50;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="975" y="572" width="210" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3_15" value='&lt;b&gt;dlq-replayer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#444444"&gt;[Container: Python 3.12]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#222222"&gt;Archives dead letters to MinIO; replays on admin command (filter by reason / time).&lt;/span&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;rounded=1;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="630" y="550" width="230" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3_16" value="&lt;b&gt;Continues on page 04&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;consumers of market.normalized.v1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1960" y="400" width="250" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3_17" value="&lt;b&gt;Delivery semantics&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;At-least-once; idempotent consumers (event_id). Key=symbol -&gt; per-symbol order. DLQ = poison pills only; transient errors retried 3x (200 ms -&gt; 5 s) first." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2300" y="400" width="300" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3_18" value="WSS frames" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p3_2" target="p3_3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p3_19" value="publish" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p3_3" target="p3_4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p3_20" value="HTTPS REST" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p3_5" target="p3_6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p3_21" value="publish" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p3_6" target="p3_7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p3_22" value="consume" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;s