/ event via Kafka&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#555555"&gt;Arrow = direction of data flow&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1640" y="700" width="330" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="d5" name="05 L2-D Quant, ML &amp; Trading"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2090" pageHeight="950" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="p5_1" value='&lt;b style="font-size:20px"&gt;L2-D - Container view: Quant research, ML &amp;amp; paper trading&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:11px;color:#555555"&gt;Real-time chain (top) - ML lane (left) - quant batch lane (bottom right) - direct service arrows carry the Kafka topic name - input/output topics per service: page 06&lt;/span&gt;' style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1800" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p5_2" value="&lt;b&gt;market.candles.v1&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;rounded=1;arcSize=50;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="690" y="100" width="200" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p5_3" value="&lt;b&gt;features.online.v1&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;rounded=1;arcSize=50;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="220" width="200" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p5_4" value='&lt;b&gt;model-inference&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#444444"&gt;[Container: Python 3.12, MLflow client]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#222222"&gt;Scores features online; hot-swaps model on alias champion.&lt;/span&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;rounded=1;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="330" y="195" width="230" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p5_5" value='&lt;b&gt;strategy-engine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#444444"&gt;[Container: Python 3.12, strategy-core]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#222222"&gt;Runs strategies per bar. Reads Redis feat:*, PG strategies &amp;amp; pairs.&lt;/span&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;rounded=1;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="670" y="195" width="240" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p5_6" value='&lt;b&gt;paper-execution&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#444444"&gt;[Container: Python 3.12]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#222222"&gt;Simulated fills (fees, slippage); pre-trade risk check; ExecutionPort impl.&lt;/span&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;rounded=1;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1020" y="195" width="230" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p5_7" value='&lt;b&gt;portfolio-service&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#444444"&gt;[Container: Python 3.12]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#222222"&gt;Positions, avg price, realized / unrealized PnL (PG trading.*).&lt;/span&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;rounded=1;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1360" y="195" width="230" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p5_8" value='&lt;b&gt;risk-analytics&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#444444"&gt;[Container: Python 3.12, numpy]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#222222"&gt;Exposure, VaR95, drawdown; limit breach -&amp;gt; alert + kill-switch.&lt;/span&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;rounded=1;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1700" y="195" width="230" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p5_9" value='&lt;b&gt;mlflow&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#444444"&gt;[Container: MLflow 2 tracking + registry]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#222222"&gt;Backend PG(mlflow); artifacts MinIO cip-ml/. Alias champion = prod model.&lt;/span&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;rounded=1;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="360" width="230" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p5_10" value='&lt;b&gt;model-monitoring&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#444444"&gt;[Container: Python 3.12]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#222222"&gt;Drift PSI/KS and perf decay. In: features, predictions.&lt;/span&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;rounded=1;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="330" y="360" width="230" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p5_11" value='&lt;b&gt;model-training&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#444444"&gt;[Job: K8s Job, sklearn/xgboost/PyTorch]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#222222"&gt;Trains, evaluates, registers. Triggers: research.jobs.v1, Airflow.&lt;/span&gt;' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;rounded=1;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="330" y="